  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2025 2026 Ram 1500 Crew Cab Bucket Seat without Rear Underseat Storage\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats are compatible with 2025 2026 Ram 1500 crew cab without Rear Underseat Storage, Bucket Seat, not for vehicles with vinyl floors; 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back\nEco-Safe Certification: Our 2025 2026 RAM 1500 floor mats are recyclable and durable, with approval by GRS, SGS, IATF; Eco-safe TPE material easily withstands the rigor of daily abuse for long-lasting performance in both arctic cold and tropical heat\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The unique designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap liquids, snow, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; Even in wet conditions, the hooks can prevent the 2025 2026 RAM 1500 floor liner from slipping\nEasy To Clean: The textured skid-resistant surface is easily cleaned; Neither cumbersome vacuum cleaners nor harsh chemicals are needed; Simply shake them out or spray them down with a hose; Please remove old floor mats before installing new floor liners\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our 2025 2026 RAM 1500 accessories are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle",
